Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: ps3-spu
Architecture: ppc64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: ps3-spu-programs
Description: SPU program runner for the PS3's Cell SPEs
 spurun loads and runs an SPU program through spufs. The package loads spufs at boot and
 mounts it at /spu.

Package: ps3-spu-programs
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Breaks: ps3-spu (<< ${source:Version})
Replaces: ps3-spu (<< ${source:Version})
Description: SPU test programs for the PS3
 SPU programs (*.spu, built with spu-elf GCC) in /usr/lib/ps3/spu, run with spurun.
